# AMB-1 Drift's Wander: GLO twice is its page; on, it glides to the next piece after its wait; the key and the
# scale change halfway; the pieces keep their own settings; a knob mid-glide ends it; it is saved; AMB-1's own
# project (format 4) loads with the new pieces from their recipes and Wander off
wait 500
expect wander 0
expect piece 0
tap GLO
expect view 6
tap GLO
expect view 7
shot wander-page.png
spin K1 1
expect wander 1
# every 2 minutes, a 15 s glide
spin K2 -5
spin K4 -2
# the wait skipped: the glide starts, Garden still named until halfway
wander_skip
wait 300
expect wbusy 1
expect piece 0
wait 8000
expect piece 1
expect wbusy 1
expect par19 1
wait 8000
expect wbusy 0
expect piece 1
expect par18 60
expect par3 0
expect slotpad0 60
shot after-glide.png
# the real wait: two minutes of growing, then a 15 s glide to Voices
wait 136000
expect piece 2
expect wbusy 0
expect par22 1
# a knob mid-glide: it ends at once, on the next piece, and the knob turns from there
wander_skip
wait 2000
expect wbusy 1
tap ENV
spin K1 1
expect wbusy 0
expect piece 3
expect par0 51
expect slotpad2 85
# frozen: the clock stops
tap REC
expect frozen 1
wait 130000
expect piece 3
tap REC
expect frozen 0
# saved, and kept through a restart
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect wander 1
expect piece 3
# AMB-1 1.x's project: carried over, the new pieces as their recipes, Wander off
storev4 33
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 3
expect par0 33
expect wander 0
expect slotpad13 90
expect slotpad8 70
